Full node identity (Tier-3, node-local). Projects to /.well-known/agent.json →
the operator gallery once this repo's Tier-2 sync lands the brand.icon-reading
code (agent.json projection + opengraph-image). brand.icon reuses the node's
existing AppHeader mark as the single source.
